Simulated, Simulated.zip -> The datasets are located in the Simulated.zip\forBLOG\Filtered\Simulated\GNe50000 folder. 
They are already split into training and test sets, and in the filename the value of r* indicates the fold.

Unseen, Unseen.rar -> unseen.fas is the test set; supervised_train.fas is the training set

12SFish, we directly provide the training and test sets: 12S_Fish_train.csv and 12S_Fish_test.csv
12SFishNoise, we directly provide the training and test sets:  12S_Fish_train_Noise.csv and 12S_Fish_test_Noise.csv. In these two files corresponding to the noise-added version, 
the species information is not included in the sequence headers, as they are identical to those in the non-noisy version. 
To simplify these files, only the sequences are provided in the CSVs. For the species labels, use exactly the same ordering as in the non-noisy version.

